---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="Computational Projects — Xiaoyue Gao">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Computational Projects" title="Building through reproducible work" introduction="I am developing a computational project portfolio grounded in biological questions, transparent validation, and clear documentation." />
  <section class="content-grid shell"><p class="side-label">Current status</p><div class="prose"><h2>Projects are in development</h2><p>My current computational experience comes from cancer genomics and multi-omics research in R and Linux. My next step is to develop deeper proficiency in Python, machine learning, and scientific software development.</p><p>Completed projects will be added when their code, documentation, validation, and limitations are ready to share.</p><div class="link-row"><a class="button-link" href={site.profiles.github}>Visit GitHub</a><a class="text-link" href="/research">View research foundation</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Project roadmap</h2><p>Planned directions, not completed projects.</p></div><div class="card-grid">
    <article class="card"><p class="card-number">Planned 01</p><h3>Public cancer dataset analysis</h3><p>A reproducible Python analysis that begins with one defined biological question and documents data, methods, results, and limitations.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="card-number">Future 02</p><h3>Wet-lab data utility</h3><p>A focused tool for a repetitive task such as qPCR organization, Western blot reporting, or candidate-gene prioritization.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="card-number">Future 03</p><h3>Interpretable machine learning</h3><p>A public biomedical dataset, a defensible baseline, careful validation, error analysis, and biologically interpretable features.</p></article>
  </div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
